{"id":"c9a7faad353afdd1","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-precipitous.md","title":"Precipitous Ideal Theorem","display":"thm-precipitous — Precipitous Ideal Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-precipitous","aliases":["58-thm-precipitous"],"display":"thm-precipitous — Precipitous Ideal Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-precipitous"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-precipitous</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-precipitous — Precipitous Ideal Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e406e8afb48a5978\" href=\"?note=e406e8afb48a5978\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\kappa\">\\(I,\\kappa\\)</span> (ideal and carrier parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\)</span> (canonical precipitous-ideal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Precipitous}(I,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Precipitous}(I,\\kappa)\\)</span> (compatibility predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}precipitous}\\vdash\\mathrm{Precipitous}(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}precipitous}\\vdash\\mathrm{Precipitous}(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical upstream predicate contains the ideal guards, countable completeness, quotient forcing, and well-founded generic-ultrapower clause. This theorem only registers the legacy compatibility name and does not add an unjustified regularity hypothesis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"e406e8afb48a5978","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-precipitous-ideal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Precipitous}(I,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}precipitous}\\vdash\\mathrm{Precipitous}(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PrecipitousIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)","display":true}],"bytes":938,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-precipitous.md|58-thm-precipitous]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["e406e8afb48a5978"]}